Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 21:24:58 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] compartments: choose an automatic place among the places that
 have cell towers

About a third of the places of the data (mostly India, China and Brazil) have no cell towers, so an
Automatic app put there got an empty cell identity, a phone with no cell in a city. Places.preferring
makes the automatic choice take a place with cells when the country has one (a far one first, else
the farthest with cells); the places themselves, the search and the places a user chooses are not
changed. The service builds the preferring list once both files are read (placesForAutomatic) and
uses it in applyPersona; an app that keeps its place from an earlier run keeps it.
---
